# Alembic migrations (Postgres)

Runtime applies `alembic upgrade head` via `app.db_migrate.apply_schema()` on API/worker
startup and the container `scripts/entrypoint.sh`.

SQLite local/dev still uses `Base.metadata.create_all` (not Alembic).

```bash
cd backend
export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://dataplat:dataplat@127.0.0.1:5432/data_platform
alembic upgrade head
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe_change"
```
